message: "If you use this repository, please cite the archived release."
title: "A Reproducible Mathematical Construction of a 1 fs Period Offset from a 240.1 Hz Reference Frequency"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Topbrutus"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Topbrutus/brutus-2401-femtosecond-offset"
url: "https://github.com/Topbrutus/brutus-2401-femtosecond-offset"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible software and documentation for the exact relation
  1/240.1 - 1/f = 10^-15 s. Version 2 explicitly propagates the
  high-precision residual through a dimensionless scale factor of 2401,
  while keeping physical interpretation separate from the algebra.
keywords:
  - frequency
  - period offset
  - femtosecond
  - residual propagation
  - reproducibility
  - decimal arithmetic
